{"id":"bff9c8d0e9f70335","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-two-stack-turing-equivalence.md","title":"两个栈恰可识别递归可枚举语言","display":"thm-two-stack-turing-equivalence — 两个栈恰可识别递归可枚举语言","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-two-stack-turing-equivalence","aliases":["73-thm-two-stack-turing-equivalence"],"display":"thm-two-stack-turing-equivalence — 两个栈恰可识别递归可枚举语言","depends_on":["[[73-df-endmarked-multistack-machine]]","[[73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§8.5.2, Theorem 8.13, print pp. 357–358; PDF pp. 379–380","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":8},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-two-stack-turing-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-two-stack-turing-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-two-stack-turing-equivalence — 两个栈恰可识别递归可枚举语言"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"812a4642483884b6\" href=\"?note=812a4642483884b6\" title=\"73-df-endmarked-multistack-machine\">73-df-endmarked-multistack-machine</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"11b19b6d211be8ab\" href=\"?note=11b19b6d211be8ab\" title=\"73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages\">73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§8.5.2, Theorem 8.13, print pp. 357–358; PDF pp. 379–380"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"8"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\">\\(L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RE}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathsf{RE}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"11b19b6d211be8ab\" href=\"?note=11b19b6d211be8ab\" title=\"73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages\">73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathsf{RE}_\\Sigma\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists M\\;[\\operatorname{StackMachine}_{\\Sigma,2}(M)\\land L=L_{\\mathsf{stk},2}(M)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L\\in\\mathsf{RE}_\\Sigma\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists M\\;[\\operatorname{StackMachine}_{\\Sigma,2}(M)\\land L=L_{\\mathsf{stk},2}(M)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>先读带结束标记的输入，用一次翻栈令第二栈顶是输入首字符。第一栈保存读头左侧（最近格在顶），第二栈保存当前格及右侧；遇到底符视为无限空白。右移把写入符号推到左栈，左移把左栈顶移到右栈。反向用多带 TM 直接保存两个有限栈并模拟输入结束字符；普通输入的首个空白足以生成该标记。保留相同输入语言，不声称时间界相同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-endmarked-multistack-machine","status":"resolved","id":"812a4642483884b6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-endmarked-multistack-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages","status":"resolved","id":"11b19b6d211be8ab","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages","status":"resolved","id":"11b19b6d211be8ab","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$，$L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$；$\\mathsf{RE}_\\Sigma$ 见 [[73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{RE}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"L\\in\\mathsf{RE}_\\Sigma\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists M\\;[\\operatorname{StackMachine}_{\\Sigma,2}(M)\\land L=L_{\\mathsf{stk},2}(M)].","display":true}],"bytes":1571,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-189","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-two-stack-turing-equivalence|两个栈恰可识别递归可枚举语言]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"c955310a21272c92","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["812a4642483884b6","11b19b6d211be8ab"]}